{"id":"06f1ec898bae8895","group":"90","path":"90/90-df-decidable-theory.md","title":"Decidable Theory","display":"df-decidable-theory — Decidable Theory","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference","book_abbrev":"90","label":"90-df-decidable-theory","aliases":["90-df-decidable-theory"],"display":"df-decidable-theory — Decidable Theory","depends_on":["[[90-df-sentence]]","[[90-df-recursive-function-class]]","[[90-df-godel-numbering]]","[[90-df-predicate-logic]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"90"},{"key":"label","html":"90-df-decidable-theory"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90-df-decidable-theory</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-decidable-theory — Decidable Theory"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"714deb184f73887a\" href=\"?note=714deb184f73887a\" title=\"90-df-sentence\">90-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"137d75d038de4a47\" href=\"?note=137d75d038de4a47\" title=\"90-df-recursive-function-class\">90-df-recursive-function-class</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b86b211a75cf1748\" href=\"?note=b86b211a75cf1748\" title=\"90-df-godel-numbering\">90-df-godel-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b7d96c072a4c677f\" href=\"?note=b7d96c072a4c677f\" title=\"90-df-predicate-logic\">90-df-predicate-logic</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b7d96c072a4c677f\" href=\"?note=b7d96c072a4c677f\" title=\"90-df-predicate-logic\">90-df-predicate-logic</a> 是句子公理集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\vdash\\varphi\">\\(T\\vdash\\varphi\\)</span> 使用该处固定的有限演算。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> (fixed formal signature)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\)</span> (formal theory)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\)</span> (sentence set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"714deb184f73887a\" href=\"?note=714deb184f73887a\" title=\"90-df-sentence\">90-df-sentence</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g:\\operatorname{Expr}(S)\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(g:\\operatorname{Expr}(S)\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span> (fixed syntax encoding)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GN}_{\\operatorname{Expr}(S)}\">\\(\\mathrm{GN}_{\\operatorname{Expr}(S)}\\)</span> (effective Gödel-numbering predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"b86b211a75cf1748\" href=\"?note=b86b211a75cf1748\" title=\"90-df-godel-numbering\">90-df-godel-numbering</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rec}_1\">\\(\\mathrm{Rec}_1\\)</span> (total recursive unary-function class, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"137d75d038de4a47\" href=\"?note=137d75d038de4a47\" title=\"90-df-recursive-function-class\">90-df-recursive-function-class</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DecTh}_{S,g}\">\\(\\mathrm{DecTh}_{S,g}\\)</span> (decidable-theory predicate, defined here)</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}decidable\\text{-}theory}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\mathrm{DecTh}_{S,g}(T)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(\\exists d:\\mathbb N\\rightharpoonup\\operatorname{Expr}(S)\\;\n\\mathrm{GN}_{\\operatorname{Expr}(S)}(g,d)\\right)\\land\n\\exists\\chi_T\\in\\mathrm{Rec}_1\\;\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\left(\n\\chi_T(n)=1\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\;\n\\bigl(n=g(\\varphi)\\land T\\vdash\\varphi\\bigr)\n\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}decidable\\text{-}theory}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\mathrm{DecTh}_{S,g}(T)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(\\exists d:\\mathbb N\\rightharpoonup\\operatorname{Expr}(S)\\;\n\\mathrm{GN}_{\\operatorname{Expr}(S)}(g,d)\\right)\\land\n\\exists\\chi_T\\in\\mathrm{Rec}_1\\;\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\left(\n\\chi_T(n)=1\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\;\n\\bigl(n=g(\\varphi)\\land T\\vdash\\varphi\\bigr)\n\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DecTh}_{S,g}(T)\">\\(\\mathrm{DecTh}_{S,g}(T)\\)</span> : <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 的定理编码集合可判定</li>\n<li>存在算法可判定任意句子是否在<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span>中可证</li>\n<li>原接口只要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi_T(n)=1\">\\(\\chi_T(n)=1\\)</span> 恰好标记定理码；其它输入可以取任意不等于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span> 的自然数。将其后合成“是否等于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span>”可得布尔特征函数，但不把这一归一化额外写入原定义。</li>\n<li>与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{REAx}_{S,g}\">\\(\\mathrm{REAx}_{S,g}\\)</span> 一样，部分解码器只作为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\">\\(g\\)</span> 有效性的存在见证，不是谓词签名中未显示的参数。</li>\n<li>PA是不可判定的理论</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"90-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"714deb184f73887a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-recursive-functio